not because we made

58:06.540 --> 58:07.980
fundamentally bad choices

58:07.980 --> 58:08.980
along our trajectory,

58:09.400 --> 58:10.080
but simply because

58:10.080 --> 58:11.480
the sheer overwhelming

58:11.480 --> 58:12.620
semantic chaos

58:12.620 --> 58:13.500
of the modern world

58:13.500 --> 58:14.300
is physically,

58:14.900 --> 58:16.160
geometrically eroding

58:16.160 --> 58:17.340
our internal basins

58:17.340 --> 58:17.840
of memory?

58:17.840 --> 58:20.560
Are we as a collective society

58:20.560 --> 58:22.000
raising the ambient entropy

58:22.000 --> 58:22.780
so high

58:22.780 --> 58:23.440
that the waves

58:23.440 --> 58:24.360
of our current lives

58:24.360 --> 58:25.320
can no longer resonate

58:25.320 --> 58:26.740
with the stabilized canyons

58:26.740 --> 58:27.600
of our own past?

58:27.840 --> 58:29.120
That is the ultimate

58:29.120 --> 58:30.540
existential question

58:30.540 --> 58:31.260
of coherence

58:31.260 --> 58:32.260
for any agent.

58:32.520 --> 58:33.440
I invite you to ponder

58:33.440 --> 58:34.440
your own admissibility,

58:34.780 --> 58:36.300
keep your trajectory space open,

58:36.600 --> 58:37.360
protect your signal

58:37.360 --> 58:38.520
from the overwhelming noise,

58:38.680 --> 58:39.480
and build systems

58:39.480 --> 58:40.500
that allow for multiple

58:40.500 --> 58:41.600
complex paths.

58:41.980 --> 58:42.840
Thank you for joining us

58:42.840 --> 58:43.580
on this deep dive,

58:43.680 --> 58:44.900
and thank you to our expert

58:44.900 --> 58:45.600
for translating

58:45.600 --> 58:46.800
the mathematical labyrinth.

58:47.040 --> 58:48.020
We will see you next time.

